Lab 3 --- Create an Android Virtual Device
Objective: Create a virtual Android device for repeatable testing
without using a personal phone.
3.1 Create the AVD
Open More Actions → Virtual Device Manager or Tools → Device
Manager.
Select Create Device.
Choose a Pixel profile, such as Pixel 6 or an available equivalent.
Select a compatible system image.
Prefer an x86_64 image where available and compatible with the host.
A Google APIs image is useful for many training scenarios. Google
