Suggested starting configuration:
Setting           Initial value
---
Device            Pixel 6 or available Pixel profile
Image             x86_64 where available
Android version   Android 14 / API 34 if available and compatible
RAM               2 GB initially
Graphics          Automatic / Hardware where stable
Orientation       Portrait
