3.2 Boot and inspect
Name the AVD `MobileSecurity_API34`.
Finish the wizard.
Start the emulator.
Wait for the Android home screen.
Open Settings → About emulated device.
Record Android version, API level, model and build.
3.3 Check acceleration
In PowerShell:
``` powershell
& "$env:ANDROID_HOME\emulator\emulator.exe" -accel-check
```
Interpret the output for your installed Emulator version. If
acceleration is unavailable, check firmware virtualization, WHPX
